# BM1370 Project Standards
- Architecture: Strictly `docs/index.html` and `docs/css/style.css`.
- HTML: Must use semantic HTML5 (`<header>`, `<main>`, `<section>`, `<footer>`).
- CSS: Zero frameworks. Use CSS Grid for layout and Flexbox for alignment.
- Aesthetic: "Professional Engineering Terminal" (Dark mode, monospace for code, clean sans-serif for body).
- Accessibility: Ensure WCAG AA contrast and proper heading hierarchy (H1 -> H2 -> H3).